      "**Total Differential, Total Derivative & Multivariable Chain Rule:** Small increments $df = f_x dx + f_y dy$; tree diagrams for intermediate variables; total rate of change $\\frac{df}{dt} = \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\frac{dx}{dt} + \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\frac{dy}{dt}$; implicit partial differentiation for relations $F(x, y, z) = 0$.",
