      "**Vector/Matrix Calculus for Machine Learning:** Gradient vectors, quadratic forms $f(x) = x^T A x + b^T x + c$, symmetric positive definite Hessians, and closed-form minimization $x^* = -\\frac{1}{2} A^{-1} b$.",
