       "t": "math",
       "tex": "\\left( \\frac{\\hat{y}}{2} \\right)^2 + \\left( \\frac{\\hat{x}}{3} \\right)^2 \\le 1 \\implies \\frac{\\hat{x}^2}{3^2} + \\frac{\\hat{y}^2}{2^2} \\le 1"
