       "t": "math",
       "tex": "J = \\frac{\\partial(\\hat{x}, \\hat{y})}{\\partial(x, y)} = \\begin{vmatrix} \\frac{\\partial \\hat{x}}{\\partial x} & \\frac{\\partial \\hat{x}}{\\partial y} \\\\ \\frac{\\partial \\hat{y}}{\\partial x} & \\frac{\\partial \\hat{y}}{\\partial y} \\end{vmatrix} = \\begin{vmatrix} 0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\end{vmatrix} = (0)(0) - (3)(2) = -6"
